{
  "name": "Heart of Winter",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You master the cold element, to the point that you grow stronger as your foes succumb to the touch of ice and frost:</p><ul><li>You gain Immunity to cold damage.</li><li>At the start of every one of your turns, you gain 5 temporary hit points for each creature within 30 feet of you that is affected by your Winter's Touch class feature or your Bone-Chilling Cold Channel Divinity. If a creature is affected by both, you double the temporary hit points gained for that creature. These temporary hit points last for 1 hour and do not stack with temporary hit points applied in this manner on subsequent rounds.</li></ul>",
